# Everything Godot writes here is a build artifact, not source.
#
# The export filenames are fixed (index.html, index.wasm, index.pck, ...), so a
# new build overwrites the old one and git would carry every revision of a
# ~40MB wasm+pck pair forever. The repository is already 680MB; this folder is
# the one place where that would get materially worse.
#
# vercel.json is the exception: it configures the deploy and is hand-written.
#
# research/ is the other exception: it is hand-written source (the public
# research landing page and the published paper PDF), not a build artifact. It
# rides along with this deployment because /research has to be served from the
# same origin as the game.
*
!.gitignore
!.vercelignore
!vercel.json
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!api/
!api/**
!research/
!research/**
.vercel
.env*
